WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.710
Lamp for admins. Part two: running the board.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.150
Admins see every file, from every rep.

3
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.250
Filter the board by rep. Unassigned shows the files nobody owns yet.

4
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:24.180
To reassign a file, open it, and change the rep. The new rep gets a notification.

5
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:29.990
Admins only notes are hidden from reps. Use them for anything the rep shouldn't see.

6
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:36.910
Call for turns a note into a call for a rep, with a due date. Assigning the call also gives them the file.

7
00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:42.320
On Engine leads, you see every rep's leads, and you can change the rep on any lead.

8
00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:50.540
Each rep with a login gets up to ten fresh leads every weekday morning. Nobody gets more while they hold thirty untouched.

9
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:56.530
To hand out a batch yourself, choose the lead file from the Board, pick the rep, and press Upload.

10
00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:02.540
Every morning, check Stuck. Files with no movement in three days need a call, or a new rep.

11
00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:05.280
Next: setting up funders.
